SUMMARY:A Pet Fashion Experience: Improv Special
DESCRIPTION:Doors open at 6:30PM\nShow is from 7:00PM – 8:30PM\nStrut. Sit. Slay.\nThe Pet Fashion Show is bringing looks\, tricks\, and big personalities to the stage. Watch pets compete in style\, skill\, and “Best in Show”—with prizes\, comedians\, and plenty of surprises along the way. \nFree to Enter – We are asking for a 5 dollar donation to support Lotus. \nFeaturing Judges\nJaven Crews\, Ben Terhune\, Luke Franklin \nTalent\nLaura Stockwell\, Ian Sons\, Sam Bob Patrick\, Wes Boggs\, K.C. Campell
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/a-pet-fashion-experience-improv-special/
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 S Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Free Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/pet-show.webp
